==German==

===Etymology===
From {{affix|de|ab-|decken}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|afdekken||to cover}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈapˌdɛkən/|[ˈʔapˌdɛkən]|[-kŋ̩]}}
* {{audio|de|De-abdecken.ogg|Audio}}
* {{audio|de|De-abdecken2.ogg|Audio}}
* {{audio|de|De-abdecken3.ogg|Audio}}
* {{hyph|de|ab|de|cken}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb|ab.decken}}

# to [[cover]]
#: {{uxi|de|Ich muss noch die Leiche '''abdecken'''.|Now I have to cover the corpse.}}
# to [[cover]] costs
#: {{uxi|de|Das '''deckt''' kaum die Kosten '''ab'''.|That barely covers the costs.}}
# to [[uncover]], [[untile]]
#: {{uxi|de|Der Sturm '''deckte''' die Dächer '''ab'''.|The storm uncovered the roofs.}}

